---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-white/10 py-10 pb-28 text-sm text-mute md:pb-10">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-[min(1180px,calc(100%-2.5rem))] flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
    <p><span class="font-display text-lg text-light">Rembrandt</span> Studio, {year}</p>
    <p>Oscuridad para que la luz importe.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
